Calculé mal el viento.

508
00:27:02,333 --> 00:27:03,917
<i>Se equivocaron,</i>

509
00:27:04,000 --> 00:27:05,667
<i>ni te dieron la información.</i>

510
00:27:05,750 --> 00:27:07,208
<i>No es tu culpa.</i>

511
00:27:10,167 --> 00:27:12,250
